! 
! Spatial Tool for the Estimation of Dam Impacts
! Version 1.20, September 2011
! Sinclair Knight Merz, Melbourne
! 
! 
! ----------------------------------------
! 
! STEDI flow results
! Results for entire catchment
!
! Created:  27/10/2026 at 17:50:55
!
! Based on scenario file:                              data\Example_STEDI_scenario.scn
! Extra calculation details are available in the file: Example_STEDI_out.out
!
! ----------------------------------------
!
! Water Balance Components
!
! Q-impact    Impact of dams (Q-inflow - Q-outflow)                        (ML/timestep)
!
! Water In:
! Q-NoDams    Total inflows to the catchment                               (ML/timestep)
! Q-wfill     Total winterfill demand for dams                             (ML/timestep)
!
! Water Out:
! Q-climate   Net evaporation from dams (-ve = high rain, +ve = high evap) (ML/timestep)
! Q-demand    Total water usage from dams                                  (ML/timestep)
! Q-spill     Total water spilled from dams                                (ML/timestep)
!
! Storage Details:
! Delta-Store Total change in storage for the timestep                     (ML/timestep)
! Store-end   Total storage in dams at the end of the timestep             (ML)
!
! Downstream Flows:
! Q-bypass    Total flow in dam bypasses                                   (ML/timestep)
! Q-unimpound Total flow from unimpounded areas of the catchment           (ML/timestep)
! Q-WithDams  Total outflows from the catchment                            (ML/timestep)
!
! ----------------------------------------
!
! Water Balance Equations
!
! Delta-Store = ( Q-NoDams - Q-bypass - Q-unimpound ) + Q-wfill - Q-climate - Q-demand - Q-spill
!
! Q-WithDams = Q-spill + Q-bypass + Q-unimpound
!
! Q-impact = Q-NoDams - Q-WithDams
!
! ----------------------------------------
!
